From a78287b845414c0efdcbf92e0a86d8c8c8fc8f8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 18:15:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: bind signed snapshots to recorded materialization

Treat committed signed snapshot labels as authoritative at mount time. Require matching metadata and signature sidecars, carry the expected root hash and signature digest into the mount handler, and force signed mode so missing metadata cannot downgrade to plain EROFS.

Use the exact validated signature bytes for mapper activation and atomically persist all dm-verity sidecars before snapshot commit.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

